        "afterFontSize": 48,
        "ratio": 2
      },
      {
        "index": 52,
        "tag": "P",
        "text": "A single agent does several things of very different consequence. A front-desk agent answers questions, books appointmen",
        "fontSize": 16,
        "afterFontSize": 32,
        "ratio": 2
      },
      {
        "index": 53,
        "tag": "P",
        "text": "Govern the handover instead and each of the four is rated on its own: what kind of thing is being handed over, who is st",
        "fontSize": 16,
        "afterFontSize": 32,
        "ratio": 2
      },
      {
        "index": 54,
        "tag": "P",
        "text": "In engineering terms: authority attaches to the tool, not the agent.",
        "fontSize": 16,
        "afterFontSize": 32,
        "ratio": 2
      },
      {
        "index": 55,
        "tag": "H3",
